msgid "%s%% CI"
msgstr "%s%% 信頼区間"

msgid "Mean"
msgstr "平均値"

msgid "Median"
msgstr "中央値"

msgid "Lower"
msgstr "下限"

msgid "Upper"
msgstr "上限"

msgid "ESS"
msgstr "ESS"

msgid "R-hat"
msgstr "R-hat"

msgid ""
"The effect size corresponds to the standardized mean difference of group "
"'%1$s' - '%2$s'."
msgstr "効果量は、群 '%1$s' - '%2$s' の標準化平均差に対応します。"

msgid ""
"The standard deviation ratio corresponds to the ratio of standard deviations "
"of group '%1$s' / '%2$s'."
msgstr "標準偏差比は、群 '%1$s' / '%2$s' の標準偏差の比に対応します。"

msgid ""
"The precision allocation corresponds to the proportion of total precision "
"allocated to group '%1$s'."
msgstr "精度の配分は、全体の精度のうち群 '%1$s' に配分された割合に対応します。"

msgid "Effect size (%s)"
msgstr "効果量 (%s)"

msgid "Precision allocation (%s)"
msgstr "精度の配分 (%s)"

msgid "Degrees of freedom (%s)"
msgstr "自由度 (%s)"

msgid "Prior Plots"
msgstr "事前分布のプロット"

msgid "Effect"
msgstr "効果"

msgid "Unequal variances"
msgstr "分散が等しくない"

msgid "Outliers"
msgstr "外れ値"

msgid "Null"
msgstr "帰無"

msgid "Alternative"
msgstr "対立"

msgid "Model Preview"
msgstr "モデルのプレビュー"

msgid ""
"Please specify a prior distribution for each parameter in the Models "
"specification section (either null or alternative)."
msgstr ""
"「モデルの指定」セクションで、各パラメータの事前分布(帰無・対立のいずれか)を"
"指定してください。"

msgid "Model Summary"
msgstr "モデルの要約"

msgid "Models"
msgstr "モデル"

msgid "P(M)"
msgstr "P(M)"

msgid "This analysis uses MCMC and might require a prolonged time to complete."
msgstr "この分析はMCMCを使うため、完了までに長時間かかることがあります。"

msgid "Model Specification Preview"
msgstr "モデル指定のプレビュー"

msgid "Prior Distribution"
msgstr "事前分布"

msgid "Distribution"
msgstr "分布"

msgid ""
"The analysis will estimate multiple models using MCMC and might require a "
"prolonged time to complete."
msgstr ""
"この分析はMCMCで複数のモデルを推定するため、完了までに長時間かかることがあり"
"ます。"

